Package: bionemor
Title: Run Biological Foundation-Model Workflows from R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Tomasz", "Kalinowski", , "kalinowskit@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Run selected biological foundation-model assets and runtimes
    published through NVIDIA BioNeMo Recipes. The package manages GPU runtimes,
    model sources, durable jobs, and portable R results. It provides R
    interfaces for Evo 2 DNA workflows and ESM-2 protein embeddings. Model
    operations require a supported CUDA-capable NVIDIA GPU; no CPU fallback is
    available.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://t-kalinowski.github.io/bionemor/,
    https://github.com/t-kalinowski/bionemor
BugReports: https://github.com/t-kalinowski/bionemor/issues
OS_type: unix
SystemRequirements: Linux, Git, tar, supported CUDA-capable NVIDIA GPU, Docker
    with NVIDIA Container Toolkit (for the package-managed container runtime)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    generics,
    jsonlite,
    processx,
